{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15205440","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15205440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1520544001:1":{"text":"先生、本当に……本当に先生なんですね。てっきり、メイジたちのハッタリだと……","source_cn":"老师，你真的……真的回来了。我原本以为那个魔法师是在故...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE5D3B3B5E4FF4518","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1520544002:1":{"text":"キリメよ、なぜそう思うのだ？","source_cn":"你为什么会这么认为，锐眼？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61DD8BA3CB92A42B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1520544003:1":{"text":"だって、あいつらはホーリンから来たんですよ！我々ヤクボルの敵、陰険で狡猾なホーリンの――","source_cn":"因为他从呼临来！他们阴毒、狡诈，呼临是雅库伯尔的敌人——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F037C468D65340D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1520544004:1":{"text":"それは違うぞ、キリメ……","source_cn":"我的孩子，你错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CE17DF8262650C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1520544005:1":{"text":"違いません！先生は、ホーリンに殺されたんです！","source_cn":"我没错，是呼临人杀了你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14E4D25F8E2380E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1520544006:1":{"text":"あの時、あたしを庇って攻撃を受けていなければ、先生は死ななかった！先生の仇は必ず討ちます！この手で、奴らを引き裂いてやる……！","source_cn":"你本不该死的，如果不是要为我挡下攻击，你就还会活着！我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81B69C0A4C1A3280","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1520544007:1":{"text":"キリメ……私はホーリンの槍で死んだのではない。ヤクボルの月が呼び出した獣に喉を噛み砕かれたのだ。","source_cn":"孩子……呼临人那一枪并没有杀死我，我是被雅库伯尔之月召...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B6ECE543CC7F61C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1520544008:1":{"text":"……分かってます、でも……！","source_cn":"……我知道，可是……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5366C50ED98FC368","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1520544009:1":{"text":"ずっと……ずっと、先生に会いたかったんです……","source_cn":"老师……我想念你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAF846726C66D00B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1520544010:1":{"text":"それは、私たちも同じだよ。","source_cn":"我们都是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16D0AC26E1CCC028","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:战士锐眼":{"text":"戦士のキリメ","source":"战士锐眼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"